  "description": "Big Travel Vitus Dominer made with DH Specific tubing to ensure maximum fun and performance for the big days\n\nHit your favourite DH trails with confidence aboard the Dominer!\n\nDominer is equipped with the essential DH components. Rockshox looks after the suspnesion performance with Boxxer Select Charger with RC Damper, paired with a Super Deluxe Coil MM Tune Rear shock. The powerful Sram Guide RE keeps you in control with 200mm rotors front and Rear. SRAM GX DH 7spd groupset is easy to shift and relaible for when you need it most.\n\nSun Ringle Duroc SD37 Comp wheels and Maxxis DH tyres ensure maximum grip, with Nukeproof finishing off the spec with Handlebars, Stem and Saddle.\n\nRockshox Boxxer Select 200mm/Rockshox Super Deluxe Coil suspension\n\nSUNRingle Duroc SD37 wheelset\n\nMaxxis Assegai/Minion DHRII\n\nSRAM GX DH 7 speed drivetrain\n\nSram Guide RE brakes\n\nNukeproof finishing kit",
